# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STAGRA frontend settings
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) to override a default. Vite reads
# `.env*` files only at start-up, so restart `npm run dev` after changing one.
#
# Every variable starting with VITE_ is embedded in the browser bundle and is
# visible to anyone who can open the page. NEVER put secrets in a VITE_ variable.
# Both settings below are read by src/services/api.ts and are commented out
# here, so copying this file unchanged keeps the default behaviour (mock mode).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# VITE_USE_MOCK: where the data comes from.
#   unset (default) or any value other than the exact text "false"
#       -> MOCK MODE: the dashboard shows data generated in the browser by
#          src/data/mockData.ts. It is NOT sensor data, predictions or model results.
#          The header shows an amber "MOCK DATA" badge in this mode.
#   false
#       -> REAL MODE: the dashboard calls the FastAPI backend through the dev-server
#          proxy (/api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000, see vite.config.ts). It never falls
#          back to mock data. Start the backend first:
#            python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
#          Prediction and model-comparison pages stay "unavailable" in real mode until a
#          model has been trained and evaluated on real sensor data.
# To use real mode locally, create `.env.local` containing exactly:
#   VITE_USE_MOCK=false
# VITE_USE_MOCK=false

# VITE_API_BASE_URL: URL prefix put in front of every API path.
#   default: /api  (a relative URL, forwarded to FastAPI by the Vite dev-server proxy,
#                   so the backend needs no CORS configuration)
#   example: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api  (bypasses the proxy; needs CORS on the backend)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Leftovers from the Google AI Studio template this frontend was exported from.
# Nothing in src/, index.html or vite.config.ts reads these two variables, so
# they have no effect on this app. Kept unchanged for now; no real key is needed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"